Dear Jimmy,

I need you help, support and cooperation.

Reference is made to the attached NOI.

Following the progress of IGF skid assembly, we need the following tags, on=
 or before the 26 Nov 2024:

50-YST-2321
50-YST-2322
50-YST-2323
50-YST-2324

If we perform the inspection as notified, they will be not able to meet our=
 target date. Could you accept to waive the inspection only for these tags?=
 This is in view to the fact that they have already performed their interna=
l hydrotest successfully.

3V has no concern to waive considering that InoxFucine it is an historical =
supplier.


It will be great if you can reply to us within a couple of hours from this =
email.


Thank you


Luca Pesenti
Project Manager

